{"3489070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cozy Beach", "steam_appid": 3489070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/99d15f4b1230e656c63222dd2fc12f6b.avif?t=1787005082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras_big/99d15f4b1230e656c63222dd2fc12f6b.avif?t=1787005082 width=800 height=455 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Beach is a wholesome game set on a tropical island where you can fish and explore, solo or with friends. Catch and collect fish, go swimming, search for treasure, craft tropical drinks, or just hang out and chill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/8bdc3c8637f83e578907759fe5aefc2c.poster.avif?t=1787005082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/8bdc3c8637f83e578907759fe5aefc2c.webm?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/8bdc3c8637f83e578907759fe5aefc2c.mp4?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go fishing and try to catch a rare fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/b4397fb11227a1cadc57adb84ece369f.poster.avif?t=1787005082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/b4397fb11227a1cadc57adb84ece369f.webm?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/b4397fb11227a1cadc57adb84ece369f.mp4?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Splash around in the ocean and swim to explore new lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/449c12e16b225e50129f1badbde0e508.poster.avif?t=1787005082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/449c12e16b225e50129f1badbde0e508.webm?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/449c12e16b225e50129f1badbde0e508.mp4?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your kitty avatar and dress them up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/23bbafd9f5ae57ec1a4370a70b4822f5.poster.avif?t=1787005082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/23bbafd9f5ae57ec1a4370a70b4822f5.webm?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/23bbafd9f5ae57ec1a4370a70b4822f5.mp4?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dance the day away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/6d72e65fed44f819ebe485acecefc3b5.avif?t=1787005082\" width=1323 height=295 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/629c0cfb2739ce1e0271d3f0a1e874d5.avif?t=1787005082\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😸 Customize an adorable kitty avatar and dress them up with lots of stylish options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎣 Go fishing and try to collect everything in your fish tracking journal. Some fish are rarer than others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦈 Trade for fishing supplies with a totally bodacious surfer shark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐟 Swim around in an inflatable tube to explore the waters around the islands to find the best fishing spot.  Some fishing areas are extra productive, and some  have rare fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/64ae628f32d5240c607d7e6bd93f618d.avif?t=1787005082\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍍 Collect fruits, and craft tropical drinks with the friendly capybara barkeeper.  Tropical drinks have bonuses to boost your fishing skills - experiment and try them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Discover treasure maps and hunt for treasure- what kind of cool stuff will you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐚 Collect seashells and other little critters too - can you find every last one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/e95c37d510fe158603b6cd2e7eb39c04.avif?t=1787005082\" width=1560 height=116 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👯‍♂️ No day at the beach is complete without hanging out with your friends in multiplayer!  You can also play solo if that's more your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤪 React with emotes - jump for joy to celebrate a catch, or cry about the one that got away.  Use emotes to communicate with other players too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Jam out and dance to sweet tunes on the radio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏝 The game will have 3 different island worlds to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Cozy Beach works on the Steam Deck- so you can hang out on the beach, wherever you are! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/c9609ccd97ea9787943e72b6ea4d5b8f.avif?t=1787005082\" width=1349 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cozy Beach's demo is live now so you can dive right in and try it out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Click on the &quot;Download&quot; button above to add it to your library- the demo runs on Windows and Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/ac20e639d7e9016ff003cf5df46001f0.poster.avif?t=1787005082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/ac20e639d7e9016ff003cf5df46001f0.webm?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/ac20e639d7e9016ff003cf5df46001f0.mp4?t=1787005082\" type=\"video/mp4\"><